Description: Qt 6 archive manager with a modern HaoZip-style interface
 QArchiver (小Q解压) browses, extracts, creates, appends to, deletes from
 and tests 7z, zip, tar, gz, bz2, xz and rar archives.  Archives are read
 in-process through libarchive when possible and fall back to the bundled
 7-Zip helper otherwise.
 .
 The default modern layout follows HaoZip: a flat colourful toolbar, a
 folder pane, a details pane, one-click extraction and an optional
 7-Zip benchmark.  The previous classic layout remains available in
 Preferences.
